#: ../../toolchain/moon/package.md:1214
msgid "Use `moonc check -warn-help` to see the list of preset compiler warnings."
msgstr "`moonc check -warn-help` を使うと、プリセットされたコンパイラ警告の一覧を確認できます。"

#: ../../toolchain/moon/package.md:1217
msgid "Alert Warning"
msgstr ""

#: ../../toolchain/moon/package.md:1219
msgid ""
"Alerts are special warnings that indicate the usage of API marked with  "
"[`#internal` attribute](../../language/attributes.md#internal-attribute)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../toolchain/moon/package.md:1222
msgid ""
"All alerts have a category associated with them, which is customized by "
"the author of the API. You can enable or disable specific alert "
"categories using the `alert_<category>` warning name, or use `alert` to "
"control all alert warnings at once."
msgstr ""
"すべての alert には API 作者が定めたカテゴリがあります。`alert_<category>` "
"という警告名で特定カテゴリを有効または無効にでき、`alert` を使えばすべての alert 警告をまとめて制御できます。"

#: ../../toolchain/moon/package.md:1226
msgid ""
"For example, the following configuration enables all alert warnings "
"except the `unsafe` category. In CI, add `--deny-warn` to `moon check`, "
"`moon test`, or the equivalent command to treat enabled warnings as fatal"
" errors."
msgstr ""
"例えば、次の設定は `unsafe` カテゴリ以外のすべての alert 警告を有効にします。CI "
"で有効な警告を致命的エラーとして扱うには、`moon check`、`moon test`、または同等のコマンドに `--deny-warn` "
"を追加してください。"

#: ../../toolchain/moon/package.md:1232
msgid "warnings = \"+alert-alert_unsafe\"\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../toolchain/moon/package.md:1237
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"warn-list\": \"+alert-alert_unsafe\"\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../toolchain/moon/package.md:1245
msgid "Virtual Package"
msgstr ""

#: ../../toolchain/moon/package.md:1247
msgid ""
"A virtual package serves as an interface of a package that can be "
"replaced by actual implementations."
msgstr ""

#: ../../toolchain/moon/package.md:1249
msgid "Declarations"
msgstr ""

#: ../../toolchain/moon/package.md:1251
msgid ""
"The `virtual` field is used to declare the current package as a virtual "
"package."
msgstr ""

#: ../../toolchain/moon/package.md:1253
msgid ""
"For example, the following declares a virtual package with default "
"implementation:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../toolchain/moon/package.md:1262
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"virtual\": {\n"
"    \"has-default\": true\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../toolchain/moon/package.md:1272
msgid "Implementations"
msgstr ""

#: ../../toolchain/moon/package.md:1274
msgid ""
"Use `virtual(implement: \"package/path\")` to declare the virtual package "
"implemented by the current package."
msgstr "`virtual(implement: \"package/path\")` で、現在のパッケージが実装する仮想パッケージを宣言します。"

#: ../../toolchain/moon/package.md:1277
msgid "For example, the following implements a virtual package:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../toolchain/moon/package.md:1281
msgid "virtual(implement: \"moonbitlang/core/abort\")\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../toolchain/moon/package.md:1286
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"implement\": \"moonbitlang/core/abort\"\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../toolchain/moon/package.md:1294
msgid "Overriding implementations"
msgstr ""

#: ../../toolchain/moon/package.md:1296
msgid ""
"The `overrides` field is used to provide the implementations that "
"fulfills an imported virtual package."
msgstr ""

#: ../../toolchain/moon/package.md:1298
msgid ""
"For example, the following overrides the default implementation of the "
"builtin abort package with another package:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../toolchain/moon/package.md:1302
msgid ""
"options(\n"
"  overrides: [ \"moonbitlang/dummy_abort/abort_show_msg\" ],\n"
")\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../toolchain/moon/package.md:1309
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"overrides\": [\"moonbitlang/dummy_abort/abort_show_msg\"]\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
